rained to predict the next word in a text are able to perform other tasks displaying intelligence."}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4416050957", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.2508.15361", "title": "A Survey on Large Language Model Benchmarks", "publication_year": 2025, "type": "preprint", "cited_by_count": 4, "open_access": {"is_oa": true, "oa_status": "green", "oa_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2508.15361", "any_repository_has_fulltext": true}, "primary_location": {"id": "pmh:oai:arXiv.org:2508.15361", "doi": null, "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2508.15361", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2508.15361", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306400194", "display_name": "arXiv (Cornell University)", "issn_l": "2331-8422", "issn": ["2331-8422"], "is_oa": true, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/I205783295

